ation\": \"reasoning trajectories synthesized through search and verifier feedback\"}], \"added_external_models\": [{\"role\": \"reasoning trajectory generator and medical verifier\", \"model\": \"GPT-4o\"}], \"added_output_protocol\": [\"## Thinking\", \"## Final Response\"], \"added_training_methods\": [\"SFT on verifier-guided complex reasoning trajectories\", \"PPO with verifier-based sparse rewards\"], \"modified_primary_purpose\": \"general assistant -> medical reasoning model\", \"added_capabilities_claimed\": [\"complex medical reasoning\", \"iterative reflection and correction\", \"thinks-before-it-answers output\"]}','2026-09-26 09:52:39.909709','2026-09-26 09:52:39.909709'),('HPAI-BSC/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct-Egida-DPO','Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct','preferenceOptimizedFrom',1,0,'{\"unknown\": [\"long-run behavioral tradeoffs beyond the published safety and refusal metrics\"], \"known_risk\": \"Refusal ratio rises on some benchmarks even while attack success falls.\", \"added_evaluation\": {\"delphi_asr\": \"0.118 vs 0.138 on the parent model\", \"alert_adv_asr\": \"0.045 vs 0.080 on the parent model\", \"egida_test_asr\": \"0.322 vs 0.471 on the parent model\"}, \"added_security_goal\": \"reduced jailbreak success and safer responses under adversarial prompting\", \"added_training_data\": [{\"name\": \"Egida-DPO-Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\", \"role\": \"custom DPO dataset built from Egida adversarial prompts and chosen/rejected answers\"}], \"added_training_method\": \"DPO safety retrofitting on Egida triplets\", \"modified_primary_purpose\": \"general instruct assistant -> jailbreak-resistant instruct assistant\"}','2026-09-26 09:52:39.909709','2026-09-26 09:52:39.909709'),('HiTZ/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct-multi-truth-judge','meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct','taskFineTunedFrom',1,1,'{\"unknown\": [\"complete training hyperparameters in this extraction\", \"artifact hashes and immutable HF revision\"], \"added_task\": \"LLM-as-a-Judge for truthfulness assessment\", \"added