lity than larger proprietary baselines on SimpleQA and PersonQA\", \"The model is not a medical professional and is not intended for diagnosis or treatment of disease\", \"Open-weight deployment may require additional downstream safeguards\", \"Chains of thought may contain hallucinated or unsafe-seeming content and should not be shown directly to end users without filtering, moderation, or summarization\", \"The model should be used with the Harmony chat format\"], \"architecture\": {\"family\": \"autoregressive Mixture-of-Experts Transformer\", \"layers\": 36, \"kv_heads\": 8, \"activation\": \"gated SwiGLU\", \"hidden_size\": 2880, \"context_length\": 131072, \"attention_heads\": 64, \"parameter_count\": 116830000000, \"position_embedding\": \"RoPE with YaRN extension\"}, \"capabilities\": [\"chain-of-thought reasoning\", \"competition mathematics\", \"coding\", \"agentic web browsing\", \"Python tool use\", \"developer-provided function calling\", \"structured outputs\", \"variable reasoning effort\", \"multilingual evaluation capability\"], \"intended_use\": \"Open-weight text generation for general-purpose reasoning, coding, agentic workflows, web browsing, Python execution, developer-provided functions, and structured outputs. The model supports configurable low, medium, and high reasoning effort and is intended to run under the Harmony chat format.\", \"release_date\": \"2025-08-05\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-120b\", \"https://github.com/openai/gpt-oss\"], \"knowledge_cutoff\": \"2024-06\"}, \"datasets\": [{\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"gpt-oss pretraining corpus\", \"size\": \"trillions of tokens\", \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:gpt-oss-pretraining-corpus\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"processing\": [\"Filtered for harmful content, especially hazardous biosecurity knowledge, using CBRN pretraining filters reused from GPT-4o.\"], \"description\": \"Text-only pretraining data focused on STEM, coding, and general knowledge.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"gpt-oss distillation data\", \"size\": null, \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:gpt-oss-distillation-data\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"processing\": [], \"description\": \"Undisclosed data generated or selected for the model\'s reported large-scale distillation stage.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"undisclosed\"}, {\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"gpt-oss post-training problem mixture\", \"size\": null, \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:gpt-oss-post-training-problem-mixture\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"processing\": [\"Used for CoT reinforcement learning and tool-use training.\", \"The model card reports training for browsing, Python, and developer-provided functions.\"], \"description\": \"A broad post-training mixture of coding, mathematics, science, and other problems used for reasoning and tool-use training.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"MMLU\", \"size\": null, \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"cais/mmlu\", \"provider\": \"Cais\", \"processing\": [], \"description\": \"College-level multitask language understanding benchmark.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"AIME 2024\", \"size\": null, \"lice