on\": \"Open-weight users may fine-tune the model to bypass safety refusals or optimize harmful capabilities.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model can hallucinate, including in factual answers and chains of thought.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Unfiltered chains of thought may contain hallucinated content or language inconsistent with OpenAI safety policies.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model\'s health outputs should not be treated as professional diagnosis or treatment advice.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The open-weight release creates a risk that downstream modifications alter the model\'s safety and capability profile.\"}], \"risk_summary\": \"The model is safety-trained and did not reach OpenAI\'s indicative High capability thresholds in the reported Preparedness categories, but its open weights can be modified by downstream actors and deployment requires additional safeguards.\", \"prohibited_use\": [{\"source_url\": \"https://github.com/openai/gpt-oss/blob/main/USAGE_POLICY\", \"description\": \"Users must comply with all applicable law when using gpt-oss-120b and gpt-oss-20b.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model is not intended to provide medical diagnosis or treatment.\"}], \"ethical_considerations\": [{\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Developers and enterprises may need safeguards beyond the model\'s default behavior to replicate system-level protections of hosted models.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Chains of thought should not be shown directly to end users without additional filtering, moderation, or summarization.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model was evaluated fo