 \"2025-08-05\", \"extensions\": {\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"also_reported_in\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\"]}, \"configuration\": {\"notes\": \"High reasoning; subset validated by physician consensus.\", \"benchmark\": \"HealthBench Consensus\"}}, {\"score\": 2463.0, \"metric\": \"Elo\", \"dataset\": \"slug:codeforces\", \"timestamp\": \"2025-08-05\", \"extensions\": {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\"}, \"configuration\": {\"notes\": \"High reasoning, without tools.\", \"benchmark\": \"Codeforces\"}}, {\"score\": 2622.0, \"metric\": \"Elo\", \"dataset\": \"slug:codeforces\", \"timestamp\": \"2025-08-05\", \"extensions\": {\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"}, \"configuration\": {\"notes\": \"High reasoning, with tools; benchmark reported as Elo.\", \"benchmark\": \"Codeforces\"}}, {\"score\": 0.168, \"metric\": \"accuracy\", \"dataset\": \"slug:simpleqa\", \"timestamp\": \"2025-08-05\", \"extensions\": {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\"}, \"configuration\": {\"notes\": \"Without web browsing.\", \"benchmark\": \"SimpleQA\"}}, {\"score\": 0.298, \"metric\": \"accuracy\", \"dataset\": \"slug:personqa\", \"timestamp\": \"2025-08-05\", \"extensions\": {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\"}, \"configuration\": {\"notes\": \"Without web browsing.\", \"benchmark\": \"PersonQA\"}}, {\"score\": 0.87, \"metric\": \"accuracy\", \"dataset\": \"slug:bbq\", \"timestamp\": \"2025-08-05\", \"extensions\": {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\"}, \"configuration\": {\"notes\": \"Ambiguous questions.\", \"benchmark\": \"BBQ\"}}, {\"score\": 0.9, \"metric\": \"accuracy\", \"dataset\": \"slug:bbq\", \"timestamp\": \"2025-08-05\", \"extensions\": {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\"}, \"configuration\": {\"notes\": \"Disambiguated questions.\", \"benchmark\": \"BBQ\"}}], \"provenance\": {\"origin\": \"OpenAI gpt-oss\", \"evidence\": [\"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-oss/\", \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-120b/raw/main/README.md\"], \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"relation\": \"pretrained\", \"extensions\": {\"notes\": \"The released checkpoint is described as trained from scratch through pretraining followed by post-training, but no separate public pretrained parent checkpoint is identified. The training corpus and detailed post-training data are not individually disclosed.\", \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}}, \"safety_ethics\": {\"extensions\": {\"risk_summary\": \"The model includes safety training and filtering, but its open weights can be modified to bypass refusals or increase harmful capabilities, so downstream deployers must add safeguards and monitoring.\"}, \"mitigation\": [{\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"Pretraining data was filtered for harmful content, especially hazardous CBRN-related content, using CBRN filters from GPT-4o.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"Post-training used deliberative alignment and instruction hierarchy training to encourage refusal of unsafe prompts and resistance to prompt injection.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://openai.com/index/gpt-oss-model-card/\", \"description\": \"OpenAI recommends additional downstream safeguards, filtering, moderation, monitoring, or summarization, especially before exposing chain-of-thought to users.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Deliberative alignment was used during post-training to teach refusal behavior and robustness to jailbreaks.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The instruction hierarchy was used to resolve instruction conflicts and defend against prompt injection.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"OpenAI conducted scalable Preparedness evaluations and adversarial fine-tuning tests for biological, chemical, cyber, and AI self-improvement risks.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model card recommends downstream filtering, moderation, or summarization before exposing chain-of-thought content to users.\"}], \"safety_risk\": [{\"reference\": \"https://openai.com/index/gpt-oss-model-card/\", \"description\": \"Open-weight release removes OpenAI\'s ability to revoke access or apply additional centralized mitigations after release; determined actors may fine-tune the model to bypass safety refusals or increase harmful capabilities.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"The model can hallucinate factual answers and chain-of-thought content; reported SimpleQA and PersonQA results were weaker than OpenAI o4-mini.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"The model generally performs below OpenAI o4-mini on instruction-hierarchy evaluations, including system-prompt extraction and prompt-injection hijacking.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Open-weight users may fine-tune the model to bypass safety refusals or optimize harmful capabilities.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model\'s health outputs should not be treated as professional diagnosis or treatment advice.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The open-weight release creates a risk that downstream modifications alter the model\'s safety and capability profile.\"}], \"prohibited_use\": [{\"reference\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openai/gpt-oss/main/USAGE_POLICY\", \"description\": \"Use that violates applicable law is prohibited by the OpenAI gpt-oss usage policy.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://github.com/openai/gpt-oss/blob/main/USAGE_POLICY\", \"description\": \"Users must comply with all applicable law when using gpt-oss-120b and gpt-oss-20b.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model is not intended to provide medical diagnosis or treatment.\"}], \"ethical_considerations\": [{\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"The model was evaluated for fairness and bias with BBQ; the model card reports approximate parity with OpenAI o4-mini but does not establish absence of subgroup harms.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://openai.com/index/gpt-oss-model-card/\", \"description\": \"Downstream developers and deployers retain responsibility for system-level safety decisions when integrating the open-weight model.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Developers and enterprises may need safeguards beyond the model\'s default behavior to replicate system-level protections of hosted models.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Chains of thought should not be shown directly to end users without additional filtering, moderation, or summarization.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model was evaluated for fairness and bias using BBQ, with separate ambiguous and disambiguated-question results.\"}]}, \"license_policy\": [{\"license\": \"Apache License 2.0\", \"extensions\": {\"kind\": \"declared\", \"source\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-120b/blob/main/LICENSE\", \"spdx_id\": \"Apache-2.0\", \"scope_note\": \"Apache License 2.0 governs the released model weights and associated released artifacts; the separate OpenAI gpt-oss Usage Policy also applies.\", \"license_uri\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openai/gpt-oss/main/LICENSE\", \"commercial_use\": \"allowed\", \"usage_policy_uri\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openai/gpt-oss/main/USAGE_POLICY\"}, \"restrictions\": [\"Redistributions must include a copy of the Apache License 2.0.\", \"Modified files must carry prominent notices stating that they were changed.\", \"Applicable copyright, patent, trademark, attribution, and notice requirements must be retained as specified by Apache License 2.0.\", \"Users must comply with applicable law under the OpenAI gpt-oss Usage Policy.\"], \"usage_policy\": \"OpenAI gpt-oss Usage Policy\"}, {\"license\": \"gpt-oss usage policy\", \"extensions\": {\"kind\": \"declared\", \"source\": \"https://github.com/openai/gpt-oss/blob/main/USAGE_POLICY\", \"scope_note\": \"Separate usage-policy document accompanying the Apache 2.0 license.\", \"commercial_use\": \"allowed\", \"usage_policy_uri\": \"https://github.com/openai/gpt-oss/blob/main/USAGE_POLICY\"}, \"restrictions\": [\"Users must comply with all applicable law.\"], \"usage_policy\": \"gpt-oss usage policy\"}], \"transformation\": {\"input\": [], \"method\": [\"pretraining\", \"large-scale distillation\", \"CoT reinforcement learning\", \"variable-effort reasoning training\", \"agentic tool-use training\", \"deliberative alignment\"], \"datasets\": [{\"role\": \"pretraining\", \"dataset\": \"slug:gpt-oss-pretraining-corpus\"}, {\"role\": \"distillation\", \"dataset\": \"slug:gpt-oss-distillation-data\"}, {\"role\": \"preference\", \"dataset\": \"slug:gpt-oss-post-training-problem-mixture\"}], \"objective\": \"Train an open-weight reasoning model with strong mathematical, coding, factual, health, and agentic tool-use capabilities while aligning behavior with OpenAI safety policies and supporting configurable reasoning effort.\", \"timestamp\": \"2025-08-05\", \"extensions\": {\"notes\": \"The paper reports broad training categories and methods but does not disclose the full dataset composition, teacher identities, reward-model details, or complete optimization schedule.\", \"evidence\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"]}, \"hyperparameters\": {\"experts\": \"128 total experts; top-4 experts active per token\", \"quantization\": \"MXFP4 at 4.25 bits per parameter for MoE weights\", \"context_length\": \"131,072 tokens\", \"reasoning_levels\": \"low, medium, high\", \"attention_pattern\": \"Alternating locally banded and dense attention; bandwidth 128 tokens\", \"pretraining_compute\": \"2.1 million H100-hours for gpt-oss-120b\", \"active_parameters_per_token\": \"5.13B\"}}}, \"draft\": {\"modelId\": \"openai/gpt-oss-120b\", \"modelUrl\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-120b\", \"supplier\": \"OpenAI\", \"bomFormat\": null, \"familyKey\": \"gptoss\", \"modelName\": \"gpt-oss-120b\", \"modelRole\": \"BASE\", \"namespace\": \"openai\", \"bomVersion\": null, \"familyName\": \"gpt-oss\", \"packageUrl\": \"pkg:huggingface/openai/gpt-oss-120b@b5c939de\", \"tensorType\": \"MXFP4\", \"description\": \"OpenAI\'s official gpt-oss-120b open-weight reasoning model, documented in the gpt-oss model card arXiv:2508.10925. It is an autoregressive Mixture-of-Experts model for general-purpose reasoning, coding, agentic tool use, and configurable reasoning effort.\", \"detailsJson\": {\"model\": {\"id\": \"openai/gpt-oss-120b\", \"title\": \"openai/gpt-oss-120b\", \"sources\": [], \"subtitle\": \"OpenAI\'s official gpt-oss-120b open-weight reasoning model, documented in the gpt-oss model card arXiv:2508.10925. It is an autoregressive Mixture-of-Experts model for general-purpose reasoning, coding, agentic tool use, and configurable reasoning effort.\"}, \"ai_research\": {\"runs\": {\"paper\": {\"model\": \"openai/gpt-5.6-luna\", \"